;; Package hs is hsi, Arbace's evaluator of GHC's STG (doc/haskell/HASKELL-EVAL-SURVEY.md, HE4; HES8 (a)):
;; the STG forms of tools/hsdump stg (doc/haskell/STG-SPEC.md) loaded module by module as a program
;; needs them, compiled into trees of nodes over frame slots, and run by an eval/apply machine with an
;; explicit, heap-allocated stack per Haskell thread (update, case, apply, catch and mask frames), eager
;; blackholing, green threads with the non-threaded RTS's semantics (HES9 (a)), the primops in Go
;; (HES12 (a)), Addr# in C's flat address space (arbace/crt, HES10 (a)) and the C the libraries call as a
;; Go table by symbol (HES11 (a)).
